#: ../../intro/install.rst:5
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:7
msgid ""
"ANet is installed as a single static binary named ``anet`` (``anet.exe`` "
"on Windows). The installer downloads the binary for the platform, checks "
"it against a signed release manifest, and writes it to a directory on the"
" search path. No compiler, language runtime or superuser privilege is "
"required for a per-user installation. Linux and macOS use the shell "
"script ``install.sh``; Windows uses the PowerShell script ``install.ps1``"
" (see :ref:`intro-install-windows`)."
msgstr ""
"ANet 以名为 ``anet``\\ （Windows 上为 "
"``anet.exe``）的单个静态二进制文件安装。安装程序下载适用于当前平台的二进制文件，依据已签名的发布清单对其校验，并写入搜索路径上的某个目录。按用户安装无需编译器、语言运行时或超级用户权限。Linux"
" 和 macOS 使用 shell 脚本 ``install.sh``；Windows 使用 PowerShell 脚本 "
"``install.ps1``\\ （参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:22 ../../intro/install.rst:201
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "环境要求"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:24
msgid "Supported platforms"
msgstr "支持的平台"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:25
msgid ""
"Linux, macOS, and Windows 10 version 1809 or later or Windows Server 2019"
" or later, each on amd64 and arm64. Windows runs the native Windows "
"build; WSL2 is not required."
msgstr ""
"amd64 与 arm64 架构上的 Linux、macOS，以及 Windows 10 1809 或更高版本、Windows Server "
"2019 或更高版本。Windows 运行原生 Windows 版本，无需 WSL2。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:29
msgid "Tools used by the installer"
msgstr "安装程序使用的工具"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:30
msgid ""
"On Linux and macOS: ``curl``, ``gzip`` (``gunzip``), ``sha256sum`` or "
"``shasum``, and ``ssh-keygen`` from OpenSSH 8.1 or later. The signature "
"check uses ``ssh-keygen``. If it is missing, the installer stops and "
"names the package to install; no option skips the signature check. On "
"Windows: Windows PowerShell 5.1 or PowerShell 7, and no other tool."
msgstr ""
"Linux 和 macOS：\\ ``curl``\\ 、\\ ``gzip``\\ （``gunzip``）、\\ ``sha256sum`` "
"或 ``shasum``，以及 OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本中的 ``ssh-keygen``\\ 。签名检查使用 ``ssh-"
"keygen``\\ 。如果缺少该工具，安装程序会停止并指出需要安装的软件包；没有任何选项可以跳过签名检查。Windows：Windows "
"PowerShell 5.1 或 PowerShell 7，无需其他工具。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:36
msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:37
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS to the download host. A node needs no inbound connection "
"and no public address."
msgstr "可向下载主机发起出站 HTTPS 连接。节点不需要入站连接，也不需要公网地址。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:43
msgid "Installing with the script"
msgstr "使用脚本安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:45
msgid "Run the installer for the current user:"
msgstr "为当前用户运行安装程序："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:51
msgid ""
"The binary is written to ``~/.local/bin/anet``. If that directory is not "
"on the search path, add it in the shell profile:"
msgstr "二进制文件写入 ``~/.local/bin/anet``\\ 。如果该目录不在搜索路径上，请在 shell 配置文件中添加："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:58
msgid ""
"Before anything is written outside a temporary directory, the installer "
"performs these checks. A failure of any check ends the installation and "
"leaves the installed version unchanged."
msgstr "在向临时目录之外写入任何内容之前，安装程序执行以下检查。任何一项检查失败都会终止安装，并保持已安装的版本不变。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:62
msgid "``release.json`` carries a valid signature by the ANet release key."
msgstr "``release.json`` 带有 ANet 发布密钥的有效签名。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:63
msgid "The manifest has not expired."
msgstr "清单未过期。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:64
msgid ""
"The manifest does not name a version older than the ``anet`` already "
"installed at the destination."
msgstr "清单所列版本不低于目标位置已安装的 ``anet``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:66
msgid ""
"The SHA-256 digest of the downloaded archive, and of the binary inside "
"it, equals the digest in the manifest."
msgstr "所下载归档及其中二进制文件的 SHA-256 摘要，与清单中的摘要一致。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:68
msgid ""
"The new binary reports the version and the module set that the manifest "
"names for its variant. The default variant must not contain the ``shell``"
" module."
msgstr "新二进制文件报告的版本和模块集合，与清单中为其变体所列的一致。默认变体不得包含 ``shell`` 模块。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:72
msgid ""
"The manifest and its signature are stored next to the binary, so that "
"``anet doctor`` can repeat the check later."
msgstr "清单及其签名存放于二进制文件旁，以便 ``anet doctor`` 日后重复该检查。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:75
msgid ""
"When the script finishes it runs ``anet init``, which writes the safe "
"default configuration (see :ref:`intro-install-init`), and prints the "
"result of ``anet doctor``."
msgstr ""
"脚本结束时会运行 ``anet init`` 以写入安全的默认配置（参见 :ref:`intro-install-init`），并输出 "
"``anet doctor`` 的结果。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:82
msgid "Installer options"
msgstr "安装程序选项"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:84
msgid "Options follow ``sh -s --`` when the script is read from a pipe."
msgstr "从管道读取脚本时，选项跟在 ``sh -s --`` 之后。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:90
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:91 ../../intro/install.rst:275
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:92
msgid "``--user``"
msgstr "``--user``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:93
msgid "Install to ``~/.local/bin``. This is the default."
msgstr "安装到 ``~/.local/bin``，为默认值。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:94
msgid "``--system``"
msgstr "``--system``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:95
msgid "Install to ``/usr/local/bin``. ``sudo`` is used when required."
msgstr "安装到 ``/usr/local/bin``，需要时使用 ``sudo``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:96
msgid "``--prefix DIR``"
msgstr "``--prefix DIR``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:97
msgid "Install to ``DIR``. Overrides ``--user`` and ``--system``."
msgstr "安装到 ``DIR``，优先于 ``--user`` 和 ``--system``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:98
msgid "``--base URL``"
msgstr "``--base URL``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:99
msgid ""
"Download from ``URL`` instead of the default hosts (see :ref:`intro-"
"install-hosts`). Only ``https://`` is accepted. The environment variable "
"``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` names a host that is tried before the default "
"hosts. Every host is checked in the same way."
msgstr ""
"从 ``URL`` 下载，而不使用默认主机（见 :ref:`intro-install-hosts`\\ ）。仅接受 ``https://``\\"
" 。环境变量 ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` 指定一个在默认主机之前尝试的主机。所有主机均以相同方式校验。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:103
msgid "``--shell``"
msgstr "``--shell``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:104
msgid ""
"Install the variant that can run operator-approved commands. This is a "
"different binary, not a setting; see :ref:`intro-install-modules`."
msgstr "安装可运行经运维者批准的命令的变体。这是另一个二进制文件，而不是一项设置，参见 :ref:`intro-install-modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:106
msgid "``--agents[=LIST]``"
msgstr "``--agents[=LIST]``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:107
msgid ""
"After installation, run ``anet agents wire`` for the coding agents found "
"on the machine, or only for the comma-separated ``LIST`` (``claude``, "
"``codex``, ``cursor``, ``opencode``, ``hermes``, ``workbuddy``)."
msgstr ""
"安装完成后，对本机上发现的编程 Agent 运行 ``anet agents wire``，或仅对以逗号分隔的 ``LIST`` "
"运行（``claude``\\ 、\\ ``codex``\\ 、\\ ``cursor``\\ 、\\ ``opencode``\\ 、\\ "
"``hermes``\\ 、\\ ``workbuddy``）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:110
msgid "``--hub URL``"
msgstr "``--hub URL``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:111 ../../intro/install.rst:283
msgid "Start the node and register it with the hub at ``URL`` as the last step."
msgstr "最后一步启动节点，并将其注册到位于 ``URL`` 的 Hub。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:113
msgid "``--name NAME``"
msgstr "``--name NAME``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:114
msgid "The name to register under. The default is the host name."
msgstr "注册所用的名称，默认为主机名。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:115
msgid "``--without MODULES``"
msgstr "``--without MODULES``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:116
msgid ""
"Switch off the listed modules in the configuration. See :ref:`intro-"
"install-modules`."
msgstr "在配置中关闭所列模块。参见 :ref:`intro-install-modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:118
msgid "``--help``"
msgstr "``--help``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:119
msgid "Print the option summary."
msgstr "输出选项摘要。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:121
msgid ""
"The options ``--hub`` and ``--name`` may be combined with ``--agents`` to"
" install, register and connect the local coding agents in one command:"
msgstr "选项 ``--hub`` 和 ``--name`` 可与 ``--agents`` 组合，以一条命令完成安装、注册并连接本地编程 Agent："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:129
msgid ""
"The registration output is printed as the last lines. On a hub that "
"admits by AID, the last line is the ``anet-hub admit`` command that the "
"hub operator runs; registration then completes without further input. See"
" :doc:`tutorial` for the full sequence."
msgstr ""
"注册输出位于最后几行。在按 AID 准入的 Hub 上，最后一行是 Hub 运维者需要运行的 ``anet-hub admit`` "
"命令，此后注册无需进一步输入即可完成。完整流程参见 :doc:`tutorial`\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:134
msgid ""
"Hubs no longer use invitation codes. The installer rejects the former "
"options ``--token`` and ``--token-file`` and says so."
msgstr "Hub 不再使用邀请码。安装程序会拒绝原有的 ``--token`` 与 ``--token-file`` 选项，并予以说明。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:140
msgid "Download hosts"
msgstr "下载主机"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:142
msgid ""
"Without ``--base``, the installer tries these hosts in order and uses the"
" first one that serves a release manifest and its signature:"
msgstr "不指定 ``--base`` 时，安装程序按以下顺序尝试各主机，并使用第一个提供发布清单及其签名的主机："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:145
msgid "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn``"
msgstr "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:146
msgid "``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``"
msgstr "``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:147
msgid ""
"The npm package of the build, ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>`` "
"(``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-<os>-<cpu>`` with ``--shell``), through the "
"content delivery networks npmmirror "
"(``https://registry.npmmirror.com/<package>/latest/files``), jsDelivr "
"(``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/<package>@latest``) and unpkg "
"(``https://unpkg.com/<package>@latest``). ``<cpu>`` is ``x64`` or "
"``arm64``."
msgstr ""
"该构建的 npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>``\\ （使用 ``--shell`` 时为 "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-<os>-<cpu>``\\ ），经由内容分发网络 npmmirror（\\ "
"``https://registry.npmmirror.com/<package>/latest/files``\\ ）、jsDelivr（\\"
" ``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/<package>@latest``\\ ）和 unpkg（\\ "
"``https://unpkg.com/<package>@latest``\\ ）获取。\\ ``<cpu>`` 为 ``x64`` 或 "
"``arm64``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:155
msgid ""
"The directory ``dl/`` of each npm package holds ``release.json``, its "
"signature and the archive of the build exactly as the project hosts serve"
" them under ``/dl/``. Which host answers does not change what is "
"accepted: the checks above apply to every host, and a manifest that a "
"host serves and that fails a check ends the installation instead of "
"moving on to the next host. A content delivery network can serve an older"
" release for a while after a new one is published; the installer then "
"installs that release, or refuses it when a newer ``anet`` is already "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"每个 npm 包的 ``dl/`` 目录保存 ``release.json``\\ 、其签名和该构建的归档，与项目主机在 ``/dl/`` "
"下提供的文件完全相同。由哪个主机响应不影响接受的内容：上述检查适用于所有主机；某个主机提供的清单若未通过检查，安装即告结束，而不会转向下一个主机。新版本发布后，内容分发网络可能在一段时间内仍提供旧版本；此时安装程序安装该版本，若已安装更新的"
" ``anet`` 则拒绝安装。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:167 ../../intro/install.rst:228
msgid "Verifying the installer before running it"
msgstr "运行前验证安装程序"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:169
msgid ""
"``curl ... | sh`` trusts the host that serves the script and that host's "
"TLS certificate. The signature checks above protect the binary, not the "
"script itself. To avoid trusting the host, download the script and its "
"signature, and verify both with the published release key before running "
"the script."
msgstr ""
"``curl ... | sh`` 信任提供该脚本的主机及其 TLS "
"证书。上述签名检查保护的是二进制文件，而不是脚本本身。若不愿信任该主机，请下载脚本及其签名，并在运行脚本之前用公布的发布密钥验证二者。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:175
msgid ""
"The release key belongs to the project maintainers. It signs binaries, "
"the installer and the manifest of release artifacts. It is not an "
"identity key of any node. The key and its fingerprint are also published "
"in ``SECURITY.md`` and ``README.md`` of the ANet repository; compare them"
" with the values below, and use the repository copy if they differ."
msgstr ""
"发布密钥属于项目维护者，用于签署二进制文件、安装程序和发布产物的清单，不是任何节点的身份密钥。密钥及其指纹也公布于 ANet 仓库的 "
"``SECURITY.md`` 和 ``README.md`` 中；请与下列值比对，二者不一致时以仓库中的副本为准。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:188
msgid ""
"The key fingerprint is "
"``SHA256:/4FMm/jgZcBII3z3O3r81Y8SxFfugdLRu3zj2gnclD4``. A successful "
"check prints ``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" signature`` "
"followed by the fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"密钥指纹为 ``SHA256:/4FMm/jgZcBII3z3O3r81Y8SxFfugdLRu3zj2gnclD4``\\ 。检查成功时会输出 "
"``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" signature``，后接指纹。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:195
msgid "Installing on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:197
msgid ""
"The Windows build runs natively on Windows 10 version 1809 or later and "
"on Windows Server 2019 or later, on amd64 and arm64. WSL2 is not "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Windows 版本在 Windows 10 1809 或更高版本以及 Windows Server 2019 或更高版本上原生运行，支持 "
"amd64 与 arm64，无需 WSL2。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:203
msgid ""
"Windows PowerShell 5.1 or PowerShell 7. The installer uses no other tool;"
" in particular it does not use ``ssh-keygen``, because Windows 10 version"
" 1809 ships an OpenSSH release older than 8.1."
msgstr ""
"Windows PowerShell 5.1 或 PowerShell 7。安装程序不使用其他工具，尤其不使用 ``ssh-keygen``\\ "
"，因为 Windows 10 1809 自带的 OpenSSH 版本低于 8.1。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:206
msgid ""
"A PowerShell window that is not elevated. The node, and every command "
"that it runs for a controller, run as the user who installs it. The "
"installer refuses to run in an elevated window unless ``-Elevated`` is "
"given."
msgstr ""
"一个未提升权限的 PowerShell 窗口。节点及其为控制方运行的每条命令，都以执行安装的用户身份运行。除非指定 ``-Elevated``\\"
" ，安装程序拒绝在已提升权限的窗口中运行。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:209
msgid "Outbound HTTPS to the download hosts."
msgstr "可向下载主机发起出站 HTTPS 连接。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:212
msgid "Installing with the one-line command"
msgstr "使用单行命令安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:214
msgid ""
"Run the following line in PowerShell. ``<controller AID>`` is the AID of "
"the node that is to be given access to the shell module of this computer:"
msgstr "在 PowerShell 中运行以下命令。\\ ``<controller AID>`` 是将获准访问本机 shell 模块的节点的 AID："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:221
msgid ""
"The first statement adds TLS 1.2 to the protocols of the session, which "
"Windows PowerShell 5.1 requires. Without ``-Controller``, the same line "
"installs the default build only and changes nothing else."
msgstr ""
"第一条语句为当前会话的协议加入 TLS 1.2，这是 Windows PowerShell 5.1 所必需的。不指定 "
"``-Controller`` 时，同一行命令仅安装默认版本，不更改其他任何内容。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:230
msgid ""
"The one-line command trusts the host that serves ``install.ps1`` and its "
"TLS certificate. To avoid that trust, download the script and its "
"signature, verify the signature with the release key, and run the "
"verified copy."
msgstr ""
"单行命令信任提供 ``install.ps1`` 的主机及其 TLS "
"证书。若不愿信任该主机，请下载脚本及其签名，用发布密钥验证签名，然后运行已验证的副本。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:234
msgid ""
"The signature is checked with ``ssh-keygen -Y verify`` from OpenSSH 8.1 "
"or later (``ssh -V`` prints the version). The following block writes the "
"file ``allowed_signers`` with the release key line given in :ref:`intro-"
"install-verify` as UTF-8 without a byte order mark, which ``ssh-keygen`` "
"requires; the ``>`` redirection of Windows PowerShell 5.1 writes UTF-16. "
"It runs the check in ``cmd.exe``, which provides the input redirection "
"that PowerShell lacks, and stops before running the script when the "
"signature does not verify:"
msgstr ""
"签名使用 OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本的 ``ssh-keygen -Y verify`` 检查（\\ ``ssh -V`` "
"输出版本号）。以下代码块以不带字节顺序标记的 UTF-8 写入文件 ``allowed_signers``\\ ，内容为 "
":ref:`intro-install-verify` 中给出的发布密钥行，这是 ``ssh-keygen`` 的要求；Windows "
"PowerShell 5.1 的 ``>`` 重定向写出 UTF-16。代码块在提供输入重定向的 ``cmd.exe`` "
"中执行检查（PowerShell 不支持输入重定向），签名验证未通过时在运行脚本之前停止："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:250
msgid ""
"When this computer has an older OpenSSH, copy ``install.ps1``, "
"``install.ps1.sig`` and ``allowed_signers`` to a computer with OpenSSH "
"8.1 or later and run the check there. The command is the same in "
"``cmd.exe`` and in a POSIX shell:"
msgstr ""
"本机的 OpenSSH 版本低于 8.1 时，请将 ``install.ps1``\\ 、\\ ``install.ps1.sig`` 与 "
"``allowed_signers`` 复制到装有 OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本的计算机上执行检查。该命令在 "
"``cmd.exe`` 与 POSIX shell 中相同："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:259
msgid ""
"A successful check prints ``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" "
"signature`` followed by the key fingerprint. Only then run the verified "
"copy in PowerShell, in the directory that holds it:"
msgstr ""
"检查成功时会输出 ``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" "
"signature``，后接密钥指纹。仅在此之后，才在 PowerShell 中，于保存该副本的目录内运行已验证的副本："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:268
msgid "Installer parameters"
msgstr "安装程序参数"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:274
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:276
msgid "``-Controller <AID>``"
msgstr "``-Controller <AID>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:277
msgid ""
"Install the build with the ``shell`` module, give exactly this AID access"
" to it (see :ref:`intro-install-windows-controller`), and join "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` unless ``-Hub`` is given."
msgstr ""
"安装含 ``shell`` 模块的版本，仅授予该 AID 访问权限（参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows-"
"controller`），并加入 ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``\\ ，除非指定了 ``-Hub``\\ "
"。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:280
msgid "``-Shell``"
msgstr "``-Shell``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:281
msgid "Install the build with the ``shell`` module. No caller is given access."
msgstr "安装含 ``shell`` 模块的版本。不向任何调用方授予访问权限。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:282
msgid "``-Hub <URL>``"
msgstr "``-Hub <URL>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:285
msgid "``-Name <name>``"
msgstr "``-Name <name>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:286
msgid "The name to register under. The default is the computer name."
msgstr "注册所用的名称，默认为计算机名。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:287
msgid "``-Prefix <directory>``"
msgstr "``-Prefix <directory>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:288
msgid ""
"Install to this absolute directory. The default is "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``. The directory must be private to the "
"user, and no directory above it may grant another account the right to "
"rename it or to change its access control list. A directory name that "
"contains ``;`` or ``%`` is refused."
msgstr ""
"安装到该绝对路径目录。默认为 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``。该目录必须为当前用户私有，且其上层的任何目录都不得向其他账户授予重命名该目录或更改其访问控制列表的权限。目录名中含有"
" ``;`` 或 ``%`` 时会被拒绝。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:293
msgid "``-Without <modules>``"
msgstr "``-Without <modules>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:294
msgid ""
"Switch off the listed modules in the configuration, as ``install.sh "
"--without`` does (see :ref:`intro-install-modules`). The configuration is"
" changed after the binary is installed."
msgstr ""
"在配置中关闭所列模块，与 ``install.sh --without`` 相同（参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"modules`）。配置在二进制文件安装完成后才会修改。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:297
msgid "``-Base <URL or directory>``"
msgstr "``-Base <URL or directory>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:298
msgid ""
"Download from this ``https://`` address, or read a release from this "
"local directory, instead of the default hosts. Every check is the same."
msgstr "从该 ``https://`` 地址下载，或从该本地目录读取发布版本，而不使用默认主机。所有检查均相同。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:300
msgid "``-NoAutostart``"
msgstr "``-NoAutostart``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:301
msgid "Do not write the value that starts the node at logon."
msgstr "不写入登录时启动节点的注册表值。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:302
msgid "``-NoPath``"
msgstr "``-NoPath``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:303
msgid "Do not add the installation directory to the user's ``PATH``."
msgstr "不将安装目录加入用户的 ``PATH``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:304
msgid "``-Elevated``"
msgstr "``-Elevated``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:305
msgid ""
"Required to install from an elevated PowerShell window. The controller "
"then runs its commands with administrator rights."
msgstr "从已提升权限的 PowerShell 窗口安装时必须指定。此时控制方将以管理员权限运行其命令。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:308
msgid ""
"The download hosts are those of :ref:`intro-install-hosts`. The npm "
"packages of the Windows builds are ``@agentnetwork/anet-win32-<cpu>`` and"
" ``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-win32-<cpu>``."
msgstr ""
"下载主机与 :ref:`intro-install-hosts` 相同。Windows 版本的 npm 包为 ``@agentnetwork"
"/anet-win32-<cpu>`` 与 ``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-win32-<cpu>``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:313
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "路径"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:319
msgid "Item"
msgstr "项目"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:320
msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:321
msgid "Binary"
msgstr "二进制文件"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:322
msgid ""
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet\\anet.exe``, with the release manifest "
"``anet.exe.release.json`` and its signature ``anet.exe.release.json.sig``"
" beside it."
msgstr ""
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet\\anet.exe``，其旁边存放发布清单 "
"``anet.exe.release.json`` 及其签名 ``anet.exe.release.json.sig``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:325
msgid "Data directory"
msgstr "数据目录"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:326
msgid "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``"
msgstr "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:327
msgid "Runtime directory"
msgstr "运行时目录"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:328
msgid "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run``"
msgstr "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:329
msgid "Start at logon"
msgstr "登录时启动"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:330
msgid ""
"The value ``AgentNetwork`` under "
"``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run``. Removing the"
" value stops the start at logon."
msgstr ""
"``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run`` 下的值 "
"``AgentNetwork``。删除该值即不再于登录时启动。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:335
msgid "What the installer checks"
msgstr "安装程序检查的内容"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:337
msgid ""
"``install.ps1`` is signed (``install.ps1.sig``) and carries the SHA-256 "
"digests of the Windows release binaries."
msgstr ""
"``install.ps1`` 已签名（\\ ``install.ps1.sig``），并载有 Windows 发布二进制文件的 SHA-256 "
"摘要。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:339
msgid ""
"Nothing that is downloaded is run or installed before it matches those "
"digests."
msgstr "下载的任何内容在与这些摘要一致之前，都不会被运行或安装。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:341
msgid ""
"The downloaded binary then verifies, with the release key built into it, "
"the signature of ``release.json``, its expiry, its version, the SHA-256 "
"digest of the binary itself and its module set, and it refuses a "
"downgrade."
msgstr ""
"随后，下载的二进制文件使用其内置的发布密钥，验证 ``release.json`` 的签名、有效期、版本、二进制文件自身的 SHA-256 "
"摘要及其模块集合，并拒绝降级。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:344
msgid "No option skips a check."
msgstr "没有任何选项可以跳过检查。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:349
msgid "What ``-Controller`` opens"
msgstr "``-Controller`` 开放的内容"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:351
msgid "``-Controller`` changes exactly the following, and nothing else:"
msgstr "``-Controller`` 仅更改以下各项，不更改其他任何内容："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:353
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The configuration block ``modules.shell = "
"{\"allow\":[\"<AID>\"],\"allow_arbitrary\":true,\"shell\":\"powershell\"}``."
msgstr ""
"配置块 ``modules.shell = "
"{\"allow\":[\"<AID>\"],\"allow_arbitrary\":true,\"shell\":\"powershell\"}``\\"
" 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:355
msgid "The AID on ``peers.allow``."
msgstr "``peers.allow`` 中的该 AID。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:356
msgid ""
"The defaults of ``anet init``: the inbound policy ``closed``, no public "
"capabilities and spending limits of 0 (see :ref:`intro-install-init`)."
msgstr ""
"``anet init`` 的默认值：入站策略 ``closed``\\ 、无公开能力、支付限额为 0（参见 :ref:`intro-"
"install-init`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:358
msgid "The registration with the hub."
msgstr "向 Hub 的注册。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:360
msgid ""
"The installer asks one confirmation on the console, through ``anet init "
"--shell-controller``. Declining it leaves the access closed. The recovery"
" passphrase is not asked during the installation (``anet hub-register "
"--passphrase-later``); set it afterwards with ``anet identity protect``. "
"Access is revoked with ``anet peers remove <AID>`` and by removing the "
"``modules.shell`` block. The shell module on Windows is described in :ref"
":`topics-shell-windows`."
msgstr ""
"安装程序通过 ``anet init --shell-controller`` "
"在控制台上请求一次确认。拒绝确认则不开放访问。安装过程中不询问恢复口令（\\ ``anet hub-register --passphrase-"
"later``）；之后请用 ``anet identity protect`` 设置。撤销访问权限的方法是执行 ``anet peers "
"remove <AID>`` 并删除 ``modules.shell`` 配置块。Windows 上的 shell 模块见 :ref"
":`topics-shell-windows`\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:369
msgid "Background operation"
msgstr "后台运行"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:371
msgid ""
"``anet up`` starts the daemon detached from the console. The daemon keeps"
" running when the PowerShell window is closed, stops at logoff, and "
"starts again at logon through the ``Run`` value above. It runs as the "
"logged-on user and never as a Windows service."
msgstr ""
"``anet up`` 以脱离控制台的方式启动守护进程。关闭 PowerShell 窗口后守护进程继续运行，注销时停止，登录时通过上述 "
"``Run`` 值再次启动。它以已登录用户的身份运行，从不作为 Windows 服务运行。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:377
msgid "Updating on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上更新"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:379
msgid ""
"``anet update`` applies the checks described in :ref:`intro-install-"
"update`. A running ``anet.exe`` cannot be overwritten, so the update "
"renames it aside and puts the new binary in its place. The daemon keeps "
"the old binary until it is restarted. Windows PowerShell 5.1 has no "
"``&&`` operator; run the two commands one after the other:"
msgstr ""
"``anet update`` 执行 :ref:`intro-install-update` 所述的检查。运行中的 ``anet.exe`` "
"无法被覆盖，因此更新会将其重命名到一旁，再将新二进制文件放到原位置。守护进程在重启之前继续使用旧的二进制文件。Windows PowerShell"
" 5.1 没有 ``&&`` 运算符；请依次运行以下两条命令："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:391
msgid "Uninstalling on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上卸载"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:393
msgid "Stop the daemons with ``anet stop --all``."
msgstr "用 ``anet stop --all`` 停止各守护进程。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:394
msgid ""
"Remove the value ``AgentNetwork`` under "
"``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run``."
msgstr ""
"删除 ``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run`` 下的值 "
"``AgentNetwork``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:396
msgid "Delete the directory ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``."
msgstr "删除目录 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:397
msgid "Remove that directory from the user's ``PATH``."
msgstr "从用户的 ``PATH`` 中移除该目录。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:399
msgid ""
"The data directory ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` holds the identity. Delete it"
" only deliberately, as described in :ref:`intro-install-remove`."
msgstr ""
"数据目录 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` 保存身份。仅在确有意图时删除，方法见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"remove`。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:405
msgid "Installing with npm"
msgstr "使用 npm 安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:407
msgid ""
"The npm package ``@agentnetwork/anet`` runs the same release binary. It "
"needs Node.js 18 or later:"
msgstr "npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 运行相同的发布二进制文件，需要 Node.js 18 或更高版本："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:415
msgid ""
"The package contains a launcher and no binary. The build of the platform "
"is in the optional dependency ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>``, as the "
"archive and the signed release manifest. Before the first run of a "
"version, the launcher checks that ``release.json`` carries a valid "
"signature by the ANet release key (the file ``allowed_signers`` of the "
"package) and names the version of the package, and that the SHA-256 "
"digests of the archive and of the binary equal the digests in the "
"manifest. A failure of any check stops the launcher before anything is "
"run. The checked binary is written, with the manifest and its signature, "
"to ``~/.cache/anet/npm/<version>/`` "
"(``~/Library/Caches/anet/npm/<version>/`` on macOS, "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\npm\\<version>`` on Windows, or below "
"``XDG_CACHE_HOME`` when it is set) and is run from there."
msgstr ""
"该包包含一个启动器，不含二进制文件。当前平台的构建位于可选依赖 ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>`` "
"中，形式为归档和已签名的发布清单。某个版本首次运行之前，启动器检查 ``release.json`` 带有 ANet 发布密钥（包中的 "
"``allowed_signers`` 文件）的有效签名并注明该包的版本，且归档及二进制文件的 SHA-256 "
"摘要与清单中的摘要一致。任何一项检查失败，启动器都会在运行任何程序之前停止。通过检查的二进制文件连同清单及其签名写入 "
"``~/.cache/anet/npm/<version>/``\\ （macOS 上为 "
"``~/Library/Caches/anet/npm/<version>/``\\ ；Windows 上为 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\npm\\<version>``\\ ；设置了 ``XDG_CACHE_HOME`` "
"时位于其下），并从该处运行。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:428
msgid ""
"Update the package with ``npm update --global @agentnetwork/anet``. Do "
"not run ``anet update`` on an installation from npm: the launcher runs "
"the version of the package and replaces a changed binary with that "
"version on its next run. Installations with ``--omit=optional`` lack the "
"build and are refused with a message. The variant with the ``shell`` "
"module is not available through the launcher; install it with "
"``install.sh --shell``, or on Windows with ``install.ps1 -Shell``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``npm update --global @agentnetwork/anet`` 更新该包。不要对通过 npm 安装的 ``anet``"
" 运行 ``anet update``\\ ：启动器运行的是该包的版本，下次运行时会以该版本替换已变更的二进制文件。使用 "
"``--omit=optional`` 的安装缺少构建，启动器会给出提示并拒绝运行。启动器不提供包含 ``shell`` 模块的变体；请使用 "
"``install.sh --shell`` 安装，Windows 上请使用 ``install.ps1 -Shell``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:436
msgid ""
"The package also contains ``install.sh`` and ``install.sh.sig``, so that "
"the installer can be obtained from npm when the project hosts cannot be "
"reached, for example from "
"``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@agentnetwork/anet@latest/install.sh``. "
"Verify it as described in :ref:`intro-install-verify` before running it."
msgstr ""
"该包还包含 ``install.sh`` 和 ``install.sh.sig``\\ ，以便在项目主机不可达时从 npm 获取安装程序，例如 "
"``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@agentnetwork/anet@latest/install.sh``\\ "
"。运行之前，请按 :ref:`intro-install-verify` 所述进行验证。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:444
msgid "Checking the installation"
msgstr "检查安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:446
msgid ""
"``anet version`` prints the version and the modules that the binary "
"contains. The list is read from the module registry of the running "
"binary, not from a string written at build time."
msgstr "``anet version`` 输出版本以及二进制文件所含的模块。该列表读取自正在运行的二进制文件的模块注册表，而不是构建时写入的字符串。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:460
msgid "Initial configuration"
msgstr "初始配置"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:462
msgid ""
"``anet init`` writes the safe defaults explicitly into ``config.json`` in"
" the data directory, so that each value is visible and changeable instead"
" of existing only as a built-in default. The command is idempotent. It "
"adds keys that are missing and never changes a value that exists. "
"Settings that differ from a fresh installation are listed in its report "
"and left for the operator to decide."
msgstr ""
"``anet init`` 将安全的默认值明确写入数据目录中的 "
"``config.json``，使每个值都可见、可更改，而不是仅作为内置默认值存在。该命令是幂等的：它添加缺失的键，从不更改已存在的值。与全新安装不同的设置会列在其报告中，由运维者自行决定。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:482
msgid "The written values are:"
msgstr "写入的值如下："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:488
msgid "Key"
msgstr "键"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:489
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:490
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:491
msgid "``inbound.policy``"
msgstr "``inbound.policy``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:492
msgid "``closed``"
msgstr "``closed``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:493
msgid "Only peers on the allow or trust list can send tasks."
msgstr "只有允许列表或信任列表中的对端可以发送任务。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:494
msgid "``inbound.public_capabilities``"
msgstr "``inbound.public_capabilities``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:495
msgid "``[]``"
msgstr "``[]``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:496
msgid "No capability is open to callers that are not on a list."
msgstr "不向名单之外的调用方开放任何能力。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:497
msgid "``payments.auto_max``"
msgstr "``payments.auto_max``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:498 ../../intro/install.rst:501
msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:499
msgid "No payment is made without confirmation on a terminal."
msgstr "未经终端确认，不进行任何支付。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:500
msgid "``payments.agent_max``, ``payments.agent_daily_max``"
msgstr "``payments.agent_max``\\ 、\\ ``payments.agent_daily_max``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:502
msgid "Payments requested through MCP or the local A2A interface are not made."
msgstr "不执行通过 MCP 或本地 A2A 接口请求的支付。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:504
msgid "``payments.explicit_max``, ``payments.daily_max``"
msgstr "``payments.explicit_max``\\ 、\\ ``payments.daily_max``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:505
msgid "``10``, ``50``"
msgstr "``10``\\ 、\\ ``50``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:506
msgid "Limits for a payment confirmed on a terminal: per payment and per UTC day."
msgstr "在终端上确认的支付的限额：每笔和每个 UTC 日。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:508
msgid "``no_response_after``"
msgstr "``no_response_after``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:509
msgid "``\"15m\"``"
msgstr "``\"15m\"``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:510
msgid ""
"A task that hears nothing from its peer for this period after delivery "
"fails."
msgstr "任务在送达后的该时段内未收到对端的任何回应即失败。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:512
msgid "``content_retention``"
msgstr "``content_retention``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:513
msgid "``\"30d\"``"
msgstr "``\"30d\"``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:514
msgid "Task content is deleted this long after the task ends."
msgstr "任务内容在任务结束该时长之后删除。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:516
msgid ""
"``peers.allow``, ``peers.trust`` and ``peers.deny`` are the peer lists, "
"one AID per line. ``payees.allow`` is the payee list. Automatic payment "
"goes only to AIDs on it, and the file is empty at first."
msgstr ""
"``peers.allow``\\ 、\\ ``peers.trust`` 和 ``peers.deny`` 是对端列表，每行一个 AID。\\ "
"``payees.allow`` 是收款方列表，自动支付只付给其中的 AID，该文件起初为空。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:520
msgid ""
"``anet doctor`` reads the data directory, without needing the daemon, and"
" reports which of these values hold. Each deviation from the defaults is "
"listed separately."
msgstr "``anet doctor`` 无需守护进程即可读取数据目录，并报告其中哪些值成立。每一处偏离默认值的情况单独列出。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:527
msgid "Starting the node"
msgstr "启动节点"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:535
msgid ""
"``anet up`` starts the daemon in the background. It continues to run "
"after the terminal closes. ``anet status`` prints the AID, the data "
"directory, the address of the local console and the hub state. Until the "
"node is registered with a hub, the hub state is ``none`` and the status "
"carries the command to run next:"
msgstr ""
"``anet up`` 在后台启动守护进程，终端关闭后仍继续运行。\\ ``anet status`` 输出 "
"AID、数据目录、本地控制台的地址以及 Hub 状态。节点注册到 Hub 之前，Hub 状态为 "
"``none``，状态输出中附有下一步应运行的命令："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:545
msgid ""
"The registration and the first exchange are described in :doc:`tutorial`."
" For the lifecycle commands, see :ref:`reference-cli`."
msgstr "注册和首次交换见 :doc:`tutorial`\\ 。生命周期命令参见 :ref:`reference-cli`\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:548
msgid ""
"The data directory is ``~/.anet`` (``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` on Windows). "
"Set ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` to use another location. Further identities, "
"created with ``anet id new NAME``, are kept under ``~/.anet/ids/NAME``. "
"The data directory contains the identity (``identity.kel``), the "
"configuration, the peer lists, the evidence chain and the control token. "
"The directory must not be shared or copied to another machine while the "
"original keeps running. The sections on :ref:`unprotected identities "
"<topics-identity-unprotected>` and on :ref:`recovery <topics-identity-"
"protect>` describe how to protect it."
msgstr ""
"数据目录为 ``~/.anet``\\ （Windows 上为 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``）。设置 "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 可使用其他位置。使用 ``anet id new NAME`` 创建的其他身份保存在 "
"``~/.anet/ids/NAME`` "
"之下。数据目录包含身份（``identity.kel``）、配置、对端列表、证据链和控制令牌。原节点仍在运行时，不得共享该目录，也不得将其复制到另一台机器。关于"
" :ref:`未受保护的身份 <topics-identity-unprotected>` 和 :ref:`恢复 <topics-"
"identity-protect>` 的章节说明了如何保护它。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:560
msgid "Connecting coding agents"
msgstr "连接编程 Agent"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:562
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire`` registers the MCP server of the node with the coding"
" agents installed on the machine and adds usage instructions to them. "
"Every file the command edits is backed up first."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire`` 将节点的 MCP 服务器注册到本机上安装的编程 "
"Agent，并向其添加使用说明。该命令修改的每个文件都会先备份。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:570
msgid ""
"A single tool can be named instead of ``--all``: ``claude``, ``codex``, "
"``cursor``, ``opencode``, ``hermes`` or ``workbuddy``. ``anet agents`` "
"lists which of them are installed and wired, and ``anet agents unwire`` "
"reverses the change. The agent must be restarted after wiring. See "
":doc:`/howto/coding-agents`; the guide for each tool, with verification "
"steps, starts at :doc:`/agents/index`."
msgstr ""
"可以指定单个工具来代替 ``--all``：``claude``\\ 、\\ ``codex``\\ 、\\ ``cursor``\\ 、\\ "
"``opencode``\\ 、\\ ``hermes`` 或 ``workbuddy``\\ 。\\ ``anet agents`` "
"列出其中已安装和已配置的工具，``anet agents unwire`` 撤销该变更。配置之后须重启 Agent。参见 :doc:`/howto"
"/coding-agents`\\ ；各工具的指南及验证步骤请从 :doc:`/agents/index` 开始。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:579
msgid "Selecting modules"
msgstr "选择模块"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:581
msgid ""
"The node is built from modules. The prebuilt release contains two "
"variants."
msgstr "节点由模块构建。预构建的发布版本包含两个变体。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:584
msgid "``default``"
msgstr "``default``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:585
msgid ""
"Every module except ``shell``. Modules that act for other nodes or spend "
"credit are disabled at run time until the operator configures them."
msgstr "除 ``shell`` 之外的所有模块。代表其他节点行事或花费额度的模块，在运维者完成配置之前，于运行时处于停用状态。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:588 ../../intro/install.rst:628
msgid "``shell``"
msgstr "``shell``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:589
msgid ""
"The default variant plus the ``shell`` module, which can run commands "
"approved by the operator. Even this variant runs nothing until the "
"configuration names the commands and lists the AIDs that may call them; "
"an empty list refuses every caller. The variant is selected with "
"``--shell`` (``-Shell`` or ``-Controller`` on Windows) at installation "
"and is retained by ``anet update``."
msgstr ""
"默认变体加上 ``shell`` 模块，后者可以运行经运维者批准的命令。即便是该变体，在配置中指明命令并列出可调用它们的 AID "
"之前，也不会运行任何内容；空列表会拒绝所有调用方。该变体在安装时通过 ``--shell``\\ （Windows 上为 ``-Shell`` 或"
" ``-Controller``）选择，并由 ``anet update`` 保持。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:596
msgid ""
"The module names are used for the installer option, for ``anet init`` and"
" in the configuration."
msgstr "模块名称用于安装程序选项、\\ ``anet init`` 和配置。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:603
msgid "Module"
msgstr "模块"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:604
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:605
msgid "``a2a``"
msgstr "``a2a``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:606
msgid "The loopback A2A interface for A2A clients."
msgstr "面向 A2A 客户端的回环 A2A 接口。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:607
msgid "``anetlink``"
msgstr "``anetlink``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:608
msgid "Client for device capabilities provided by ANetLink."
msgstr "ANetLink 所提供设备能力的客户端。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:609
msgid "``autoreply``"
msgstr "``autoreply``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:610
msgid ""
"Answering tasks with a local agent, including the sandbox, the credential"
" injection route, the egress allow list and the budgets."
msgstr "以本地 Agent 应答任务，包括沙箱、凭据注入路由、出站允许列表和预算。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:612
msgid "``blackboard``"
msgstr "``blackboard``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:613
msgid "Shared blackboard capabilities."
msgstr "共享黑板能力。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:614
msgid "``cas``"
msgstr "``cas``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:615
msgid "Content-addressed storage capabilities."
msgstr "内容寻址存储能力。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:616
msgid "``console``"
msgstr "``console``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:617
msgid "The local web console."
msgstr "本地 Web 控制台。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:618
msgid "``mcp``"
msgstr "``mcp``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:619
msgid "The MCP server and the coding agent wiring."
msgstr "MCP 服务器及编程 Agent 的配置。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:620
msgid "``org``"
msgstr "``org``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:621
msgid "Verification of organisation membership credentials."
msgstr "组织成员凭证的验证。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:622
msgid "``p2p``"
msgstr "``p2p``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:623
msgid "Direct delivery between nodes."
msgstr "节点之间的直接投递。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:624
msgid "``preview``"
msgstr "``preview``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:625
msgid "Streaming previews of a result in progress."
msgstr "进行中的结果的流式预览。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:626
msgid "``service``"
msgstr "``service``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:627
msgid "Local services published as capabilities."
msgstr "作为能力发布的本地服务。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:629
msgid "Operator-approved commands (variant ``shell`` only)."
msgstr "经运维者批准的命令（仅限 ``shell`` 变体）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:630
msgid "``x402``"
msgstr "``x402``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:631
msgid "Payments: quotes, authorizations, settlement and receipts."
msgstr "支付：报价、授权、结算和回执。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:633
msgid ""
"A module that is switched off behaves like a module that is not present: "
"the peer sees the same response as for a disabled feature, and every "
"local entry point answers with the reason code ``module_absent``. A "
"switched-off module is never replaced by a weaker code path."
msgstr ""
"关闭的模块与不存在的模块行为相同：对端看到的应答与功能被停用时一致，每个本地入口都以原因码 ``module_absent`` "
"应答。关闭的模块绝不会被较弱的代码路径取代。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:638
msgid ""
"``--without`` turns modules off during installation. The installer runs "
"``anet init --without`` with the freshly verified binary before it "
"replaces the installed one, so a failure leaves the system unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``--without`` 在安装期间关闭模块。安装程序在替换已安装的文件之前，用刚验证过的二进制文件运行 ``anet init "
"--without``，因此失败时系统保持不变。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:647
msgid ""
"The same switch is available on an installed node, with the daemon "
"stopped. ``--without`` adds names to the top-level ``without`` list in "
"``config.json`` and never removes one. It is refused with the reason code"
" ``without_configured`` when the configuration already contains the key "
"of the module; the key has to be removed first. ``--with`` removes one "
"name."
msgstr ""
"已安装的节点在守护进程停止时可使用同样的开关。\\ ``--without`` 向 ``config.json`` 顶层的 ``without``"
" 列表添加名称，从不移除。如果配置中已包含该模块的键，则以原因码 ``without_configured`` 拒绝，须先移除该键。\\ "
"``--with`` 移除一个名称。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:662
msgid ""
"The list can be changed only while the daemon is stopped and only on the "
"local machine. No control-plane, MCP or A2A call can change it."
msgstr "该列表只能在守护进程停止时、在本机上更改，任何控制面、MCP 或 A2A 调用都无法更改它。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:665
msgid ""
"``--without`` can name every module of the table above, including "
"``autoreply``, ``preview`` and ``console``. A module that is switched off"
" is still part of the binary. To leave the code out of the binary, build "
"from the source (see below); :ref:`topics-modules-recipes` lists the "
"combinations that the repository tests."
msgstr ""
"``--without`` 可以指定上表中的每个模块，包括 ``autoreply``、``preview`` 与 "
"``console``。被关闭的模块仍是二进制的一部分。要把代码从二进制中去掉，请从源码构建（见下文）；:ref:`topics-modules-"
"recipes` 列出仓库测试过的组合。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:670
msgid "The reference for the module behaviour is :doc:`/topics/modules`."
msgstr "模块行为的参考见 :doc:`/topics/modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:675
msgid "Building from source"
msgstr "从源码构建"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:677
msgid ""
"The source tree builds with a current Go toolchain and needs neither CGO "
"nor a C compiler."
msgstr "源码树使用当前的 Go 工具链构建，既不需要 CGO，也不需要 C 编译器。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:686
msgid ""
"``./build.sh`` writes the binary to ``./anet``. ``./build.sh --check`` "
"first runs formatting, ``go vet``, the tests and the build-tag checks. A "
"module that is included by default can be left out of the binary with "
"``--without``, which sets the build tag ``no_<module>``, and the "
"``shell`` module is added with ``--with shell``:"
msgstr ""
"``./build.sh`` 把二进制写到 ``./anet``。``./build.sh --check`` 先运行格式检查、``go "
"vet``、测试和构建标签检查。默认包含的模块可以用 ``--without`` 从二进制中去掉，它会设置构建标签 "
"``no_<module>``；``shell`` 模块用 ``--with shell`` 加入："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:697
msgid ""
"The names are those of the ``modules`` line of ``anet version``. The "
"module ``console`` has no build tag in 0.3.0; ``./build.sh --without "
"console`` stops with ``build_tag_pending`` and builds nothing, and the "
"console is turned off with ``anet init --without console`` instead. "
"``bash scripts/build.sh`` stamps the commit into the binary and takes the"
" tags in the environment variable ``TAGS``."
msgstr ""
"名称取自 ``anet version`` 的 ``modules`` 行。模块 ``console`` 在 0.3.0 "
"中没有构建标签；``./build.sh --without console`` 会以 ``build_tag_pending`` "
"停止且什么也不构建，控制台改用 ``anet init --without console`` 关闭。``bash "
"scripts/build.sh`` 把提交号写入二进制，并从环境变量 ``TAGS`` 读取标签。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:704
msgid ""
"A binary built from source carries no release signature. ``anet doctor`` "
"reports the signature state as unknown, and ``anet update`` replaces it "
"with a signed release build."
msgstr ""
"从源码构建的二进制文件不带发布签名。\\ ``anet doctor`` 将其签名状态报告为未知，``anet update`` "
"会将其替换为已签名的发布构建。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:711
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "更新"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:713
msgid ""
"``anet update`` replaces the installed binary in place. It applies the "
"same checks as the installer, using the release key that is compiled into"
" the running binary, so it does not depend on the host that served the "
"installer. The new binary is written to a temporary file in the same "
"directory and renamed over the old one; if any step fails, the old binary"
" is untouched."
msgstr ""
"``anet update`` "
"就地替换已安装的二进制文件。它使用编译进正在运行的二进制文件中的发布密钥，执行与安装程序相同的检查，因此不依赖提供安装程序的主机。新二进制文件先写入同一目录中的临时文件，再通过重命名覆盖旧文件；任何一步失败，旧二进制文件均保持不变。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:724
msgid ""
"``--check`` reports whether a newer release exists and changes nothing. "
"An update never moves to an older version, and it keeps the variant: a "
"binary that cannot run commands is never replaced by one that can. A "
"daemon that is already running keeps the old binary until it is "
"restarted:"
msgstr ""
"``--check`` "
"报告是否存在更新的发布版本，不作任何更改。更新绝不会回退到更旧的版本，并保持变体不变：无法运行命令的二进制文件绝不会被可运行命令的二进制文件取代。已在运行的守护进程在重启之前继续使用旧的二进制文件："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:733
msgid ""
"On Windows, the running ``anet.exe`` is renamed aside instead of "
"replaced; see :ref:`intro-install-windows`."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，运行中的 ``anet.exe`` 会被重命名到一旁，而不是被替换；参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"windows`\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:736
msgid ""
"``--base URL`` selects another download host, with the same checks. "
"Releases after 0.3.3 also try the npm packages of :ref:`intro-install-"
"hosts` after the project hosts. Re-running the installer is not required "
"on a machine that already has ``anet``. An installation from npm is "
"updated with npm (see :ref:`intro-install-npm`)."
msgstr ""
"``--base URL`` 选择另一个下载主机，检查相同。0.3.3 之后的版本在项目主机之后还会尝试 :ref:`intro-install-"
"hosts` 中的 npm 包。已安装 ``anet`` 的机器无需重新运行安装程序。通过 npm 安装的 ``anet`` 用 npm 更新（见"
" :ref:`intro-install-npm`\\ ）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:745
msgid "Removing ANet"
msgstr "移除 ANet"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:747
msgid "Stop the daemons and delete the binary:"
msgstr "停止守护进程并删除二进制文件："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:754
msgid "On Windows, follow the steps in :ref:`intro-install-windows` instead."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，请改按 :ref:`intro-install-windows` 中的步骤操作。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:756
msgid ""
"A hub that is the witness of an identity cannot be left with ``anet hub-"
"leave``, because without it nobody can confirm the key of the identity. "
"To move an identity to another hub, run ``anet hub-register`` with the "
"address of the new hub."
msgstr ""
"作为某个身份见证的 Hub 无法通过 ``anet hub-leave`` 退出，因为没有它，就没有人能确认该身份的密钥。如需将身份迁移到另一个 "
"Hub，请以新 Hub 的地址运行 ``anet hub-register``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:761
msgid ""
"The data directory holds the only copy of the identity keys. Deleting it "
"ends the identity permanently, and the AID cannot be recovered without "
"the recovery file and its passphrase. Delete ``~/.anet`` only when the "
"identity is no longer needed:"
msgstr ""
"数据目录保存着身份密钥的唯一副本。删除它即永久终结该身份，没有恢复文件及其口令，AID 无法恢复。仅在不再需要该身份时才删除 "
"``~/.anet``："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:773
msgid "Installation problems"
msgstr "安装问题"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:775
msgid ""
"Every message of the installer ends with the statement ``Nothing was "
"installed or changed.`` when the installation was not completed."
msgstr "安装未完成时，安装程序的每条消息都以 ``Nothing was installed or changed.`` 结尾。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:778
msgid "``ssh-keygen is required``"
msgstr "``ssh-keygen is required``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:779
msgid ""
"Install the OpenSSH client tools: ``openssh-client`` on Debian and "
"Ubuntu, ``openssh`` on Fedora and RHEL, ``openssh-keygen`` on Alpine."
msgstr ""
"安装 OpenSSH 客户端工具：Debian 和 Ubuntu 上为 ``openssh-client``，Fedora 和 RHEL 上为 "
"``openssh``，Alpine 上为 ``openssh-keygen``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:782
msgid "``is not signed by the anet release key``"
msgstr "``is not signed by the anet release key``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:783
msgid ""
"Either the download host serves a file that the release key did not sign,"
" or the installed ``ssh-keygen`` is older than OpenSSH 8.1. Try another "
"host with ``--base URL``; every host is checked in the same way."
msgstr ""
"可能是下载主机提供了并非由发布密钥签名的文件，也可能是已安装的 ``ssh-keygen`` 低于 OpenSSH 8.1。请使用 "
"``--base URL`` 尝试其他主机；每个主机的检查方式相同。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:787
msgid "``Refusing to downgrade``"
msgstr "``Refusing to downgrade``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:788
msgid ""
"The manifest names a version older than the installed one, which usually "
"indicates a stale mirror. Use ``--base URL`` to select another host."
msgstr "清单所列版本低于已安装的版本，这通常表明镜像已过期。请使用 ``--base URL`` 选择其他主机。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:792
msgid "For failures after installation, see :doc:`/howto/troubleshooting`."
msgstr "安装之后出现的故障，参见 :doc:`/howto/troubleshooting`\\ 。"

